<h3>五、Right to Appeal</h3>
<p>You have the right to appeal these findings before the Paris Commercial Court (Tribunal de commerce de Paris) within 30 days. However:</p>
<ul>
<li>Appeal does not stay the compliance payment obligation</li>
<li>Appeal filing fee: €15,000 (payable to the Tribunal)</li>
<li>Typical appeal duration: 18-24 months</li>
<li>Successful appeal rate for DSA compliance actions: <8%</li>
</ul>

<h3>六、About This Audit</h3>
<p>We understand that a luxury goods conglomerate conducting a compliance audit of an email security company may seem unusual. This is because under the <b>EU Digital Services Act (2022)</b>, online intermediaries (including email security providers) are considered "hosting services" with obligations to prevent the promotion of counterfeit goods through their systems. LVMH, as a rights holder, has standing to audit intermediary compliance under DSA Art. 22(4).</p>

